alse,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6iP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b8b71f47-bdd6-4c34-a872-156e1da991c6","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"無いならってか、`XDG_DATA_HOME` も `~/.local/share` かな","ts":"1630669744.102400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"h4Ik"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7fbb9dee-6393-41bc-913b-63c7ed9d44e9","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"おお、ありがとうございます!","ts":"1630669736.102200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IouO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c6c32266-d2c4-4841-8f79-bb92d52d3ea7","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/cli/cli/blob/029d49f3b38ebd54cd84b23732bb7efabfce4896/internal/config/config_file.go#L78-L90\u003e\n`XDG_DATA_HOME` が無いなら、`~/.local/share/gh` かな","ts":"1630669679.101300","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/cli/cli/blob/029d49f3b38ebd54cd84b23732bb7efabfce4896/internal/config/config_file.go | config_file.go\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/cli/cli/blob/029d49f3b38ebd54cd84b23732bb7efabfce4896/internal/config/config_file.go | config_file.go\u003e","text":"```\nfunc DataDir() string {\n\tvar path string\n\tif a := os.Getenv(XDG_DATA_HOME); a != \"\" {\n\t\tpath = filepath.Join(a, \"gh\")\n\t} else if b := os.Getenv(LOCAL_APP_DATA); runtime.GOOS == \"windows\" \u0026amp;\u0026amp; b != \"\" {\n\t\tpath = filepath.Join(b, \"GitHub CLI\")\n\t} else {\n\t\tc, _ := os.UserHomeDir()\n\t\tpath = filepath.Join(c, \".local\", \"share\", \"gh\")\n\t}\n\n\treturn path\n}\n```","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/cli/cli|cli/cli\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yyzUg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7de20cec-1bb8-4cd4-ba9c-c99c137463de","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/cli/cli/blob/trunk/pkg/cmd/extension/command.go#L37-L68\u003e\nupdateAvailale 見てる…","ts":"1630669544.100200","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/cli/cli/blob/trunk/pkg/cmd/extension/command.go | command.go\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/cli/cli/blob/trunk/pkg/cmd/extension/command.go | command.go\u003e","text":"```\n\textCmd.AddCommand(\n\t\t\u0026amp;cobra.Command{\n\t\t\tUse:   \"list\",\n\t\t\tShort: \"List installed extension commands\",\n\t\t\tArgs:  cobra.NoArgs,\n\t\t\tRunE: func(cmd *cobra.Command, args []string) error {\n\t\t\t\tcmds := m.List(true)\n\t\t\t\tif len(cmds) == 0 {\n\t\t\t\t\treturn errors.New(\"no extensions installed\")\n\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t\tcs := io.ColorScheme()\n\t\t\t\tt := utils.NewTablePrinter(io)\n\t\t\t\tfor _, c := range cmds {\n\t\t\t\t\tvar repo string\n\t\t\t\t\tif u, err := git.ParseURL(c.URL()); err == nil {\n\t\t\t\t\t\tif r, err := ghrepo.FromURL(u); err == nil {\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\trepo = ghrepo.FullName(r)\n\t\t\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t\t\t}\n\n\t\t\t\t\tt.AddField(fmt.Sprintf(\"gh %s\", c.Name()), nil, nil)\n\t\t\t\t\tt.AddField(repo, nil, nil)\n\t\t\t\t\tvar updateAvailable string\n\t\t\t\t\tif c.UpdateAvailable() {\n\t\t\t\t\t\tupdateAvailable = \"Upgrade available\"\n\t\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t\t\tt.AddField(updateAvailable, nil, cs.Green)\n\t\t\t\t\tt.EndRow()\n\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t\treturn t.Render()\n\t\t\t},\n\t\t},\n```","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/cli/cli|cli/cli\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"totemoturai","count":1,"users":["U022XK5866Q"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"B+xuu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0241dba3-d883-43ff-8c3e-ed6645024a62","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"ひょっとして全リポジトリ走査してる？","ts":"1630669517.099700","team":"