8951.096800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JuR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ed75a88b-885b-442a-bf17-647d53dd12e1","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"あ、遅いのは私のせいかも","ts":"1630668943.096500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=Y8Ht"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a84a4da9-3038-48f3-a722-161b88077906","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"私もそう思いますね","ts":"1630668920.096100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7+9zh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"982bcdc8-79ce-4ab9-b8f1-2872e025cd74","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"ですよね。私もそれは思ったんですが、 `gh extension list`がやけに遅くて、できれば避けたかった次第です","ts":"1630668912.096000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pQQ1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dba89883-75f8-417b-a1c6-5acd55e7ecd0","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"あれ、規格も何もあったもんじゃないシェルスクリプトですし","ts":"1630668882.095200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hu4C6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"33ea4679-7a10-4819-b922-2ee9fbc91085","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"私もそう思いました","ts":"1630668880.095100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"azFsf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1c293100-5b63-44a2-b2db-61a5eaec4b68","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"エクステンションを原則ブロックするしかなさそう","ts":"1630668871.094500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"juj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"af4e2b51-3021-4d59-a687-f262549374e2","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"質問させてください。あるサブコマンドが `list`をサブサブコマンドに持つか知る方法が欲しいです。\n\n拙作`ghf` コマンドでは、 `gh repo list | fzf` みたいなことを `gh repo`に限らずサブサブコマンドに `list` を持つものすべてでできるようにするため、\n1. `gh repo list` の標準出力を変数に代入し標準エラーを一時ファイルにリダイレクト\n2. 標準エラーが返っていれば、標準エラーを返して終了\n3. なければ続行\nという流れにしています。これなら、どのサブコマンドが  `list` サブサブコマンドを持っているか知らなくていいので保守しやすいです。\nしかし、この方法、エクステンションに対しては例えば `gh fuzzyclone list` を試してしまい、 `list`というユーザーのレポジトリを見に行ってしまいます……。\nうまい回避策はないでしょうか？\n\u003chttps://github.com/atusy/gh-fzf/blob/88806d11c1a3fe56ff564abe87f992f7b0060bb9/ghf.bash#L12-L18\u003e","ts":"1630668643.094000","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/atusy/gh-fzf/blob/88806d11c1a3fe56ff564abe87f992f7b0060bb9/ghf.bash | ghf.bash\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/atusy/gh-fzf/blob/88806d11c1a3fe56ff564abe87f992f7b0060bb9/ghf.bash | ghf.bash\u003e","text":"```\n  # Try list candidates\n  local STDERR=\"$( mktemp )\"\n  local CANDIDATES=\"$( \"$COMMAND\" \"$SUBCOMMAND\" list \"$@\" 2\u0026gt; \"$STDERR\" )\"\n  if [[ ! \"$( command cat \"$STDERR\" )\" == \"\" ]]; then\n    \"$COMMAND\" \"$SUBCOMMAND\" list \"$@\"\n    return $?\n  fi\n```","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/atusy/gh-fzf|atusy/gh-fzf\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png"}],"edited":{"user":"U022XK5866Q","ts":"1630668822.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"u3GTB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"56c77d77-1100-479c-9da1-62a8ce98bec5","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"前に居たチームでSSHにMFA使ってたな…","ts":"1630645818.084900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"z/SCc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f7470c7d-9d86-490b-b8d5-d5d14888b924","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"\u003chttps://dev.classmethod.jp/articles/amazon-linux-ssh-two-step-authentication/\u003e\nへー。SSHログインにMFA設定できるんだーと思いました。\n（別件ですが「参考にしたサイト」が全部リンク切れててつらい気持ちになりました。。）","ts":"1630645126.084300","attachments":[{"fallback":"クラスメソッド発「やってみた」系技術メディア | DevelopersIO: Amazon LinuxへのsshをGoogle Authenticatorを用いて二段階認証にしてみた | DevelopersIO","id":1,"title":"Amazon LinuxへのsshをGoogle Authenticatorを用いて二段階認証にしてみた | DevelopersIO","title_link":"https://dev.classmethod.jp/articles/amazon-linux-ssh-two-step-authentication/","text":"はじめに こんにちは植木和樹＠上越妙高オフィスです。今日はAmazon Linuxへのsshログイン時におけるセキュリティ強化のお話です。 AWS運用チェックリストではOSにログインする際のユーザーは共有せず、個人ごとに …","image_url":"https://cdn-ssl-devio-img.classmethod.jp/wp-content/uploads/2014/05/Amazon_EC2.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"クラスメソッド発「やってみた」系技術メディア | DevelopersIO","service_icon":"https://dev.classmethod.jp/apple-touch-icon.png","from_url":"https://dev.classmethod.jp/articles/amazon-linux-ssh-two-step-authentication/","original_url":"https://dev.classmethod.jp/articles/amazon-linux-ssh-two-step-authentication/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eyc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bb137abd-af83-41b7-835e-22d64567e1e7","type":"message","user":"U013QL1RAPN","text":"わたしの ProxyCommand から ProxyJump のように、あとから、より便利だといえる反証?(コマンド)がでてくる土壌があるのがいいところ。","ts":"1630644925.083200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"d/7x"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2bf2b18b-93f8-4fb9-af4d-2b95d16d04bc","type":"message","user":"U013QL1RAPN","text":"ここで見たような気もするが、なんどでも便利なものは出るといいと思うので、どんどん更新されるのがいいというのがここの方針だった気がする。","ts":"1630644695.081600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":2,"users":["U02CLFXL19A","U022XK5866Q"]},{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["U02CLFXL19A"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cmxm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"faa0fb02-b9c9-400f-b074-e1e1884df69b","type":"message","user":"U02CLFXL19A","text":"要sudoですが","ts":"1630644600.079800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8Su"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a6300953-eff7-4ad5-8842-070f411b3201","type":"message","user":"U02CLFXL19A","text":"あと、このSlackで既に話題になっているかどうか分からないのですが、\nsshuttle というSSH de 簡易VPN的なものもあるので、ポートフォワーディングの代わりになるかもです？","ts":"1630644480.079500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["UAZ33BKV2"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TQjbv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"269d45cf-ae9c-4263-8f01-db52c5c383bc","type":"message","user":"U013QL1RAPN","text":"ちょっと ~/.ssh/config おきかえてくる","ts":"1630644051.076200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1tJs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9b0077d9-3940-48da-8a39-f3c1ae106dc2","type":"message","user":"U013QL1RAPN","text":"すばらしい。","ts":"1630644032.075800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RigHQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9b06a739-0b24-4079-98ab-269c9e9269f5","type":"message","user":"U02CLFXL19A","text":"そこそこ新しめなsshなら `ProxyCommand` じゃなくて、 `ProxyJump` の方がオススメす。\n`ssh -W ...` という長ったらしいコマンドじゃなくて、踏み台に使うホスト名を指定するだけでok。\n多段踏み台もカンマ区切りで簡単指定というオプションで、コマンドラインでも `-J` という短いオプションがあるので便利す。","ts":"1630643283.075100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tips","count":3,"users":["UAZ33BKV2","U013QL1RAPN","U81LLJ340"]},{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"W5Vh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"351b71b5-0939-4f84-82ee-7ccdda945b29","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"socks5プロキシでフォワードできるからだいたいなんでもできる","ts":"1630642820.072800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KqZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a6b26c3e-af94-4a9a-81bb-673e5ae8daa9","type":"message","user":"U013QL1RAPN","text":"~/.ssh/config に ProxyCommand  を書くのも便利","ts":"1630642782.072200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"olKw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b4f52134-c44d-4228-ab32-99c332073278","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"ssh越しの開発機のローカルサーバーにブラウザからアクセスするのに日常的に使ってます。便利。","ts":"1630642382.071100","edited":{"user":"UDPT2BZ6E","ts":"1630642400.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Fgov"}]},{"client_msg_id":"da39a9fe-79ef-490e-ae53-f2d0baebe584","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"踏み台ごしにWebサーバにアクセスしたりとかたまにやりますね","ts":"1630642265.070500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QliT2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"99d13525-9f86-4622-b04b-44b65aef2059","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"なるほど。ポートフォワードって使ったことなかったですけど、そういうことできるんですね。勉強しよう。","ts":"1630641709.070000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ngIg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bd8cab44-6599-4b25-89d1-2910f5d5bb13","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"私は lemonade をポートフォワードして使っているので ssh 先でローカルのクリップボード参照したり ssh 先からローカルのブラウザで URL 開いたりできる","ts":"1630639794.069500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3c7P"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ca2e8811-b77f-4b44-8d90-8ffd8265665c","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"sshトンネルでUNIXソケットをフォワーディングしてるんですかね","ts":"1630638157.068500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Qqcoc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5d3bb02c-5cbc-47c2-9e67-5e9a3400f08d","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"これは何をしているのか。。ポートフォワーディングではない？","ts":"1630638020.067400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6G5o1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"26e44912-265e-4f48-bf64-3f7a2c8027d7","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"sshでもローカルでURLを開けるんですねえ。設定にルート必要なのでnot for meですが……\n\n\u003chttp